...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

visual_assessor: 시각 분석 에이전트 (VisualAssessor) { class: ours }
search_agent: 검색 에이전트 (SearchAgent) { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API (gemini-3-flash-preview) { class: ext }

visual_assessor -> search_agent: AgentTool 호출 (query)
search_agent -> gemini: instruction + google_search 선언
gemini -> search_agent: 그라운딩된 검색 결과
search_agent -> visual_assessor: AgentTool 반환 (텍스트)
